# Open Hadith — one canonical byte form on every platform.
# Supports docs/data-policy.md (UTF-8, NFC, LF line endings; byte-exact fingerprints).

# All text files: normalized to LF, never CRLF, on every operating system.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Core data: explicit text with LF, no platform conversion, no content filters.
*.json   text eol=lf
*.jsonl  text eol=lf
